{"id":"vod_zy360_67553","vodId":"67553","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"偶像大师","name_cn":"偶像大师","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"国产动漫","remarks":"全25集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241103-1/3bb8c49cdcd6e75037d0ea4a33603159.jpg"},"summary":"在娱乐视听高度发达的当下，少女偶像不仅圆了许多人的梦，也令很多情窦初开的女孩找到人生前进的方向。小型艺能公司765事务所便云集了12位性格各异但拥有着共同梦想的女孩子，她们是天海春香（中村绘里子配音）、星井美希（长谷川明子配音）、如月千早（今井麻美配音）、高槻やよい（仁后真耶子配音）、萩原雪步（浅仓杏美配音）、菊地真（平田宏美配音）、双海亚美（下田麻美配音）、双海真美（下田麻美配音）、水濑伊织（钉宫理惠配音）、三浦あずさ（たかはし智秋配音）、四条贵音（原由实配音）、我那霸响（沼仓爱美配音）。事务所新人男性担任摄影师，跟踪记录下女孩们成长的每一天。曾经当过偶像的制作人秋月律子（若林直美配音）则耐心引领着少女们一步步向偶像殿堂迈进。光明之路纵使充满坎坷，但没有人会拒绝品尝胜利果实的那一刻……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-03 21:06:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/VP5bWz0f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/vbsvoYWN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/wiIk1Igq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/1DWCN4Ri/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/c0SFU7W2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/YtQaMTp6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/9LNKx8Be/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/Zt9IpcE0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/uUjFU0ru/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/ZpIFZCI6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/cLO2RXPD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/ZflUlyuR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/LDcPdYhf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/eLgmvVix/index.m3u8"},{"name"